> **Farzana says:** "Lab pricing at 2ct is almost identical for both shapes — $4,825 for oval IGI D-IF, $4,735 for emerald IGI D-FL. At that price point, shape is a pure aesthetic choice. Budget is not the deciding factor. Buy the shape that matches how you want the ring to look, not the one that happens to be $90 cheaper."

